    "OpenSSH Ed25519/ECDSA keys are supported, including passphrase-protected keys (aes-ctr, aes-cbc, aes-gcm). Enter the passphrase below if the key is encrypted." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "OpenSSH-Ed25519/ECDSA-Schlüssel werden unterstützt, auch passphrasengeschützte (aes-ctr, aes-cbc, aes-gcm). Gib die Passphrase unten ein, falls der Schlüssel verschlüsselt ist."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "OpenSSH Ed25519/ECDSA keys are supported, including passphrase-protected keys (aes-ctr, aes-cbc, aes-gcm). Enter the passphrase below if the key is encrypted."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Las claves OpenSSH Ed25519/ECDSA son compatibles, incluidas las protegidas con una frase de contraseña (aes-ctr, aes-cbc, aes-gcm). Introduce la frase de contraseña más abajo si la clave está cifrada."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Les clés OpenSSH Ed25519/ECDSA sont prises en charge, y compris celles protégées par une phrase secrète (aes-ctr, aes-cbc, aes-gcm). Saisissez la phrase secrète ci-dessous si la clé est chiffrée."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "OpenSSH Ed25519/ECDSA-nøkler er støttet, inkludert passfrasebeskyttede nøkler (aes-ctr, aes-cbc, aes-gcm). Skriv inn passfrasen nedenfor hvis nøkkelen er kryptert."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "As chaves OpenSSH Ed25519/ECDSA são compatíveis, incluindo as chaves protegidas por frase-senha (aes-ctr, aes-cbc, aes-gcm). Digite a frase-senha abaixo se a chave estiver criptografada."
          }
        }
      }
    },
